{"version":1,"content":"<p>台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》現正熱播，劇情高潮迭起，掀起全城追劇熱潮。</p><p>劇中陳自瑤飾演牽動整部劇集命脈的關鍵人物「關子盈」，其好姊妹「夏無雙」（楊茜堯飾）為了替她討回公道，不惜展開連串驚心動魄的復仇大計，姊妹情深與復仇張力成為劇集一大看點。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:24:22.875439+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:15.312737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:17:15.312737+00:00","content_hash":"df5d688cf90df87e3ade9dcbcc9cf23cb3d1e3ddb21ef21e5a45a11e5a5aed9d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}